   262| * This snapshot records the LAST primary-route failure (status code, reason,
   263| * backend body) so the chat watchdog can surface a real BLOCKED banner even
   264| * when the user still received a fallback answer. It is CLEARED the moment the
   265| * primary route succeeds, so the banner hides automatically on the next clean
